[00:24.632]Simple, solemn tone
[00:28.604]in my words and shattered bone
[00:33.218]Am I talking to myself,
[00:37.492]Who's in control
[00:43.932]Guarding those long gone
[00:47.866]With a haunting, simple song
[00:53.558]Rising waves of bodies save
[00:57.867]the world from all you've wronged,
[01:02.698]I can feel the fog.
